<title>SPAIN: Bankinter '96 year dividend 612 pesetas.</title>
<headline>Bankinter '96 year dividend 612 pesetas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Bankinter is to pay a total dividend of 612 pesetas for 1996, the bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>This represents an increase of 20.47 percent versus 1995.</p>
<p>The bank said will make a fourth and final 1996 dividend payment of 156 pesetas gross per share on April 5.</p>
<p>The payout ratio is 49.53 percent in 1996, up from 47.76 percent in 1995, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
